{
    "title": "Stanford Health Care MyHealth",
    "description": "Accessing your personal health information has never been easier. The MyHealth mobile app from Stanford Health Care puts your personal information at your fingertips to make managing your health care simple, quick, and completely confidential. \r\n\r\nWith the Stanford Health Care MyHealth app you can:\r\n\r\n1.\tSchedule your in-person appointments or video visits, and eCheck-in for appointments\r\n2.\tCommunicate with your care team\r\n3.\tView test results and manage medications\r\n4.\tInside our buildings, follow step by step directions to your appointment location\r\n5.\tReview and pay bills\r\n6.\tGet up to date health information during a stay at the hospital\r\n\r\nand more\u2026",
    "descriptionHTML": "Accessing your personal health information has never been easier. The MyHealth mobile app from Stanford Health Care puts your personal information at your fingertips to make managing your health care simple, quick, and completely confidential. <br><br>With the Stanford Health Care MyHealth app you can:<br><br>1.\tSchedule your in-person appointments or video visits, and eCheck-in for appointments<br>2.\tCommunicate with your care team<br>3.\tView test results and manage medications<br>4.\tInside our buildings, follow step by step directions to your appointment location<br>5.\tReview and pay bills<br>6.\tGet up to date health information during a stay at the hospital<br><br>and more\u2026",
